; stage1_intro: 4 CRAM palettes x 16 colours, captured in Genesis Plus GX (headless)
; source: emu/explore/enter.txt, snapshot e3 (attract-mode walk into stage 1)
; RGB uses GPGX's 'normal' brightness ramp; the 0x-word (----BBB-GGG-RRR-) is authoritative.
; No ROM offset is known for this palette: CRAM is DMA'd from Work RAM.
